  "translation": "Na king i salim ol man, ol i kalim Simi, na ⟨em⟩ i tokim em: A, mi no mekim yu sware long Yahwe, na mi skruim tok long yu, mi tok olsem: Long de yu go ausait na yu wokabaut go hia na go hap, yu save tru tru — yu bai dai olgeta? Na yu tokim mi: Gutpela tok; mi harim.",
